[{"title":"","label":"第 124 则","author":"","text":"创新庵不若修古庙，读生书不若温旧业。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 124 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[123]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 125 则","author":"","text":"字与画同出一原，观六书始于象形，则可知已。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 125 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[124]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 126 则","author":"","text":" 忙人园亭，宜与住宅相连；闲人园亭，不妨与住宅相远。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 126 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[125]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 127 则","author":"","text":"酒可以当茶，茶不可以当酒；诗可以当文，文不可以当诗；曲可以当词，词不可以当曲；月可以当灯，灯不可以当月；笔可以当口，口不可以当笔；婢可以当奴，奴不可以当婢。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 127 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[126]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 128 则","author":"","text":"胸中小不平，可以酒消之；世间大不平，非剑不能消也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 128 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[127]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 129 则","author":"","text":"不得已而谀之者，宁以口，毋以笔；不可耐而骂之者，亦宁以口，毋以笔。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 129 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[128]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 130 则","author":"","text":"多情者必好色，而好色者未必尽属多情；红颜者必薄命，而薄命者未必尽属红颜；能诗者必好酒，而好酒者未必尽属能诗。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 130 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[129]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 131 则","author":"","text":"梅令人高，兰令人幽，菊令人野，莲令人淡，春海棠令人艳，牡丹令人豪，蕉与竹令人韵，秋海棠令人媚，松令人逸，桐令人清，柳令人感。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 131 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[130]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 132 则","author":"","text":"物之能感人者，在天莫如月，在乐莫如琴，在动物莫如鹃，在植物莫如柳。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 132 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[131]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 133 则","author":"","text":"妻、子颇足累人，羡和靖梅妻鹤子；奴、婢亦能供职，喜志和樵婢渔奴。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 133 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[132]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 134 则","author":"","text":"涉猎虽曰无用，犹胜于不通古今；清高固然可嘉，莫流于不识时务。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 134 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[133]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 135 则","author":"","text":"所谓美人者，以花为貌，以鸟为声，以月为神，以柳为态，以玉为骨，以冰雪为肤，以秋水为姿，以诗词为心，吾无间然矣。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 135 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[134]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 136 则","author":"","text":"蝇集人面，蚊嘬人肤，不知以人为何物！","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 136 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[135]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 137 则","author":"","text":"有山林隐逸之乐而不知享者，渔樵也，农圃也，缁黄也；有园亭姬妾之乐而不能享、不善享者，富商也，大僚也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 137 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[136]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 138 则","author":"","text":"黎举云：“欲令梅聘海棠，枨子(想是橙)臣樱桃，以芥嫁笋，但时不同耳！”予谓物各有偶，拟必于伦。今之嫁娶，殊觉未当。如梅之为物，品最清高；棠之为物，姿极妖艳。即使同时，亦不可为夫妇。不若梅聘梨花，海棠嫁杏，橼臣佛手，荔枝臣樱桃，秋海棠嫁雁来红，庶几相称耳。至若以芥嫁笋，笋如有知，必受河东狮子之累矣。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 138 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[137]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 139 则","author":"","text":"五色有太过，有不及，惟黑与白无太过。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 139 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[138]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 140 则","author":"","text":"许氏《说文》分部，有止有其部，而无所属之字者，下必注云：“凡某之属，皆从某。”赘句殊觉可笑，何不省此一句乎？","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 140 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[139]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 141 则","author":"","text":"阅《水浒传》，至鲁达打镇关西、武松打虎，因思人生必有一桩极快意事，方不枉在生一场。即不能有其事，亦须著得一种得意之书，庶几无憾耳！（如李太白有贵妃捧砚事，司马相如有文君当垆事，严子陵有足加帝腹事，王之涣、王昌龄有旗亭画壁事，王子安有顺风过江作《滕王阁序》事之类。）","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 141 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[140]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 142 则","author":"","text":"春风如酒，夏风如茗，秋风如烟，如姜芥。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 142 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[141]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 143 则","author":"","text":"冰裂纹极雅，然宜细不宜肥。若以之作窗栏，殊不耐观也。（冰裂纹须分大小，先作大冰裂，再于每大块之中作小冰裂，方佳。）","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 143 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[142]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 144 则","author":"","text":"鸟声之最佳者，画眉第一，黄鹂、百舌次之。然黄鹂、百舌，世未有笼而畜之者。其殆高士之俦，可闻而不可屈者耶。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 144 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[143]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 145 则","author":"","text":"不治生产，其后必致累人；专务交游，其后必致累己。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 145 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[144]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 146 则","author":"","text":"昔人云：“妇人识字，多致诲淫。”予谓此非识字之过也。盖识字则非无闻之人，其淫也，人易得而知耳。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 146 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[145]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 147 则","author":"","text":"善读书者，无之而非书：山水亦书也，棋酒亦书也，花月亦书也；善游山水者，无之而非山水：书史亦山水也，诗酒亦山水也，花月亦山水也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 147 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[146]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 148 则","author":"","text":"园亭之妙，在丘壑布置，不在雕绘琐屑。往往见人家园亭，屋脊墙头，雕砖镂瓦，非不穷极工巧，然未久即坏，坏后极难修葺，是何如朴素之为佳乎！","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 148 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[147]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 149 则","author":"","text":"清宵独坐，邀月言愁；良夜孤眠，呼蛩语恨。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 149 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[148]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 150 则","author":"","text":"官声采于舆论，豪右之口与寒乞之口俱不得其真；花案定于成心，艳媚之评与寝陋之评概恐失其实。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 150 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[149]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 151 则","author":"","text":"胸藏丘壑，城市不异山林；兴寄烟霞，阎浮有如蓬岛。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 151 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[150]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 152 则","author":"","text":"梧桐为植物中清品，而形家独忌之，甚且谓“梧桐大如斗，主人往外走”，若竟视为不祥之物也者。夫剪桐封弟，其为宫中之桐可知；而卜世最久者，莫过于周。俗言之不足据，类如此夫！","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 152 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[151]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 153 则","author":"","text":"多情者，不以生死易心；好饮者，不以寒暑改量；喜读书者，不以忙闲作辍。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 153 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[152]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 154 则","author":"","text":"蛛为蝶之敌国，驴为马之附庸。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 154 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[153]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 155 则","author":"","text":"立品，须发乎宋人之道学；涉世，须参以晋代之风流。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 155 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[154]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 156 则","author":"","text":"古谓禽兽亦知人伦。予谓匪独禽兽也，即草木亦复有之。牡丹为王，芍药为相，其君臣也；南山之乔，北山之梓，其父子也；荆之闻分而枯，闻不分而活，其兄弟也；莲之并蒂，其夫妇也；兰之同心，其朋友也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 156 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[155]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 157 则","author":"","text":"豪杰易于圣贤，文人多于才子。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 157 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[156]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 158 则","author":"","text":"牛与马，一仕而一隐也；鹿与豕，一仙而一凡也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 158 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[157]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 159 则","author":"","text":"古今至文，皆血泪所成。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 159 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[158]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 160 则","author":"","text":"情之一字，所以维持世界；才之一字，所以粉饰乾坤。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 160 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[159]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 161 则","author":"","text":"孔子生于东鲁。东者，生方，故礼乐文章，其道皆自无而有。释迦生于西方。西者，死地，故受想行识，其教皆自有而无。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 161 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[160]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 162 则","author":"","text":"有青山方有绿水，水惟借色于山；有美酒便有佳诗，诗亦乞灵于酒。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 162 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[161]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 163 则","author":"","text":" 严君平，以卜讲学者也；孙思邈，以医讲学者也；诸葛武侯，以出师讲学者也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 163 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[162]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 164 则","author":"","text":"人则女美于男，禽则雄华于雌，兽则牝牡无分者也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 164 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[163]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 165 则","author":"","text":"镜不幸而遇嫫母，砚不幸而遇俗子，剑不幸而遇庸将，皆无可奈何之事。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 165 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[164]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 166 则","author":"","text":"天下无书则已，有则必当读；无酒则已，有则必当饮；无名山则已，有则必当游；无花月则已，有则必当赏玩；无才子佳人则已，有则必当爱慕怜惜。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 166 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[165]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 167 则","author":"","text":"秋虫春鸟，尚能调声弄舌，时吐好音；我辈搦管拈毫，岂可甘作鸦鸣牛喘！","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 167 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[166]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 168 则","author":"","text":" 媸颜陋质，不与镜为仇者，亦以镜为无知之死物耳。使镜而有知，必遭扑破矣。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 168 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[167]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 169 则","author":"","text":"吾家公艺，恃百忍以同居，千古传为美谈。殊不知忍而至于百，则其家庭乖戾睽隔之处，正未易更仆数也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 169 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[168]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 170 则","author":"","text":"九世同居，诚为盛事。然止当与割股、庐墓者作一例看。可以为难矣，不可以为法也，以其非中庸之道也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 170 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[169]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 171 则","author":"","text":"作文之法，意之曲折者，宜写之以显浅之词；理之显浅者，宜运之以曲折之笔。题之熟者，参之以新奇之想；题之庸者，深之以关系之论。至于窘者舒之使长，缛者删之使简，俚者文之使雅，闹者摄之使静，皆所谓裁制也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 171 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[170]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 172 则","author":"","text":"笋为蔬中尤物，荔枝为果中尤物，蟹为水中尤物，酒为饮食中尤物，月为天文中尤物，西湖为山水中尤物，词曲为文字中尤物。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 172 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[171]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 173 则","author":"","text":"买得一本好花，犹且爱护而怜惜之，矧其为解语花乎！","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 173 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[172]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 174 则","author":"","text":"观手中便面，足以知其人之雅俗，足以识其人之交游。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 174 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[173]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 175 则","author":"","text":" 水为至污之所会归，火为至污之所不到。若变不洁为至洁，则水火皆然。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 175 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[174]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 176 则","author":"","text":"貌有丑而可观者，有虽不丑而不足观者；文有不通而可爱者，有虽通而极可厌者。此未易与浅人道也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 176 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[175]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 177 则","author":"","text":" 游玩山水，亦复有缘。苟机缘未至，则虽近在数十里之内，亦无暇到也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 177 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[176]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 178 则","author":"","text":"贫而无谄，富而无骄，古人之所贤也；贫而无骄，富而无谄，今人之所少也。足以知世风之降矣。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 178 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[177]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 179 则","author":"","text":"昔人欲以十年读书、十年游山、十年检藏。予谓检藏尽可不必十年，只二三载足矣。若读书与游山，虽或相倍蓰，恐亦不足以偿所愿也。必也，如黄九烟前辈之所云，人生必三百年而后可乎？","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 179 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[178]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 180 则","author":"","text":"宁为小人之所骂，毋为君子之所鄙；宁为盲主司之所摈弃，毋为诸名宿之所不知。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 180 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[179]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 181 则","author":"","text":"傲骨不可无，傲心不可有。无傲骨则近于鄙夫，有傲心不得为君子。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 181 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[180]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 182 则","author":"","text":"蝉为虫中之夷、齐，蜂为虫中之管、晏。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 182 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[181]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 183 则","author":"","text":"曰痴、曰愚、曰拙、曰狂，皆非好字面，而人每乐居之；曰奸、曰黠、曰强、曰佞，反是，而人每不乐居之，何也？","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 183 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[182]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 184 则","author":"","text":"唐、虞之际，音乐可感鸟兽。此盖唐、虞之鸟兽，故可感耳。若后世之鸟兽，恐未必然。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 184 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[183]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 185 则","author":"","text":"痛可忍，而痒不可忍；苦可耐，而酸不可耐。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 185 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[184]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 186 则","author":"","text":"镜中之影，著色人物也；月下之影，写意人物也。镜中之影，钩边画也；月下之影，没骨画也。月中山河之影，天文中地理也；水中星月之象，地理中天文也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 186 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[185]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 187 则","author":"","text":"能读无字之书，方可得惊人妙句；能会难通之解，方可参最上禅机。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 187 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[186]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}}]